<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85641" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πομφόλυζ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠγος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ </span>(ὁ, ἡ, acc. to <i><span class="en">
			Gal.
			13.639
		</span></i>): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πομφός</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bubble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				66b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				83d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πομφόλυγες</span> are the
			constituent parts of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφρός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				735b12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>boss of a shield,</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφαλός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; as architectural ornament, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.373.254
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>ornament for the head</i> worn by women, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				320.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1524.50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>zinc oxide,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				7.17
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
